  "ingredients": [
    "2 acorn squash, halved and seeded",
    "water, as needed",
    "3 tablespoons unsalted butter",
    "1 large sweet onion, chopped",
    "1 large carrot, peeled and chopped",
    "1 clove garlic, minced",
    "3.5 cups low-sodium chicken stock",
    "0.25 cup half-and-half",
    "0.5 teaspoon ground nutmeg",
    "0.5 teaspoon ground cinnamon",
    "1 pinch salt and ground black pepper to taste"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 400 degrees F (200 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/c7ao4CxchGbfWSzkrrRf1q424_k=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/229087-roasted-acorn-squash-soup-VAT-step-01-d9730b7add394a439b505db79fe6e819.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/229087/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Arrange squash, cut-side down, in a baking dish; add enough water to cover bottom of the dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/CRjsg59xR1bhz6rq7VeQWg1wp2Q=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/229087-roasted-acorn-squash-soup-VAT-step-02-34b327127e00454abd7286f453d0d9f8.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/229087/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake squash in the preheated oven until easily pierced with a fork, about 45 minutes. Remove from the oven; cool until easily handled. Scoop flesh into a bowl and set aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/0bmYVamXvuHOVIJYni2_hTBltSA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/229087-roasted-acorn-squash-soup-VAT-step-03-7e3fb9414d4e4b38a7859c94d154302d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/229087/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Melt butter in a large pot over medium-high heat. Add onion, carrot, and garlic; stir until onions soften, 5 to 7 minutes. Add stock and squash; simmer for 20 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/qVJwSQrFVn2mQu9mZjXZF78NQuI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/229087-roasted-acorn-squash-soup-VAT-step-04-29fd1b1cbd2a40f9810e49af56533d29.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/229087/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer mixture to a blender in batches and purée until smooth. Return to pot.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/9oO88svkyUWEWFa217AXM9T4A9M=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/229087-roasted-acorn-squash-soup-VAT-step-05-e2dfad6184e1485098e2d69a8dc90444.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/229087/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir in half-and-half, nutmeg, and cinnamon; season with salt and pepper. Thin the soup with water, if desired.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/eRC3szHNcGpiHdhMTYwOjUbl4oY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/229087-roasted-acorn-squash-soup-VAT-step-06-5878d8ca74804abe9e361fec20cb062b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/229087/step_06.webp"
    }
  ],
